    "Spatial Audio" : {

    },
    "Spatial Audio renders the stream through a head-tracked virtual sound stage on AirPods and other supported headphones. It's a stereo effect Holmdel applies to every station, not Dolby Atmos content from the broadcaster — radio streams carry no object-based audio to spatialize." : {

    },
